<http://vocab.belgif.be/auth/nace2025/1520002> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Manufacture of parts of footwear: uppers and parts of it, outer and inner soles, heels, etc. excluding rubber parts"@en .
